From 72c7ccdf5bff4959bae68d38ce8ba168dfd92c35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chandan <chandan@medpath.dev>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 07:56:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild landing page hero section (Revision 4)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 60/40 split hero layout: copy left, operator login card right
- Decorative background layer: blurred lab photo, radial glow,
  dot-grid, bottom wave (aria-hidden, non-interactive) — photo
  softened to an 18px blur at .30 opacity for stronger, gentler
  coverage across the full hero area
- Floating-label username/password fields (CSS-only label float)
- Per-field validation on submit with inline role=alert messages
- Loading-spinner state on the sign-in button
- Demo-credential badges that autofill + focus the relevant field
- Scoped --hero-* tokens with dark-theme overrides via
  :host-context([data-theme='dark'])
- heroIn / cardIn entrance animations, respects
  prefers-reduced-motion
- Nav, categories, stats, why-choose, CTA band and footer are
  unchanged in this revision
